# release criteria
these are the things that need to be present in each version to consider it fit for release

### v0.1:
- saving title + content + thumbnail (if applicable) from major social media platforms (youtube videos, youtube shorta, instagram posts, instagram shorts, tiktok posts, reddit posts, x posts, linkedin posts, linkedin jobs)
- AI categorization system (existing catrgories v.s entry to be added)
- chrome extension for easy adding
- responsive design
- web only
